  "title": "Don't force periodic password expiry.",
  "content": "<p>Periodic password expiry is now widely recognised as counterproductive; eg, from the UK National Cyber Security Centre:</p><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.ncsc.gov.uk/blog-post/problems-forcing-regular-password-expiry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow ugc\">The problems with forcing regular password expiry</a></strong></p><p> </p><p>Please stop this:</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/dc24530f-3b5a-4042-96a7-69e86a28e050.png\" /></figure><p> </p><p>Especially as it <em>does </em>allow you to just “reset” your password to exactly the same as it was before!</p>",
